#
# AddressSanitizer suppressions for the CI sanitizer job (.github/workflows/ci.yml,
# job 'sanitizer'), passed as ASAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=<this file>.
#
# Intentionally empty: every ASan report fails CI. Add an entry only for a
# diagnosed, third-party or known-benign report, one per line, each with a
# comment naming the issue that tracks its removal. Syntax:
#   interceptor_via_fun:<function>
#   interceptor_via_lib:<library>
#   odr_violation:<global name or glob>
# See https://github.com/google/sanitizers/wiki/AddressSanitizer#suppressing-reports-in-external-libraries
